      "locator": {
        "page": 10,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p10_s1"
      },
      "text": "Most (the Taidoor attackers for example) reuse exploits and are relatively simple to block, if one ensures that one’s network and software is regularly patched.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
